### Soul Systems — example HTTP calls (cookie session from browser, or copy Cookie header after login)

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Live SSE stream (browser EventSource or curl -N)
GET {{base}}/api/events

### Departments
GET {{base}}/api/v1/departments

### Jobs (paginated)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/jobs?page=1&limit=10&status=IN_PROGRESS

### Processes (optional filters)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/processes?departmentId=1
GET {{base}}/api/v1/processes?jobId=1

### Blueprints with routing templates
GET {{base}}/api/v1/blueprints

### Computed scheduling alerts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/alerts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/alerts?departmentId=1

### Inventory search
GET {{base}}/api/v1/inventory?q=TABLE

### Analytics (admin session required)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/analytics/summary

### Logout (clears session cookie)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
